OL,3,GNEWSAFour held after attack left man
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour arrests have been made after a man
OL,7,Fsustained "potentially life-altering"
OL,8,Fhead injuries when he was struck
OL,9,Fseveral times with a blunt object in
OL,10,FNottingham.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,13,FHarlaxton Walk, in St Ann's, at 16:20
OL,14,FBST on 12 August after it received
OL,15,Freports of an injured man in the
OL,16,Fstreet.
OL,18,FThe 35-year-old man was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with injuries that police say
OL,20,F"could potentially impact him for the
OL,21,Frest of his life".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
